msgid "Harmonic vibrational frequencies (FREQUENCIES)"
msgstr "谐波振动频率 (FREQUENCIES)"

msgid ""
"The ``FREQUENCIES`` command must be given after the energy calculation to "
"which it refers or after ``OPTG``. If the command for the energy calculation"
" (e.g. ``HF``, ``KS``, ``MP2``, etc.) is in a procedure, the ``OPTG`` and "
"``FREQUENCIES`` commands must also be in the procedure. Furthermore, no "
"procedures without an energy calculation must directly precede "
"``FREQUENCIES`` or ``OPTG``."
msgstr ""
"``FREQUENCIES`` 命令必须在其引用的能量计算之后或 ``OPTG`` 之后给出。如果能量计算的命令（例如 ``HF``\\ 、\\ "
"``KS``\\ 、\\ ``MP2`` 等）位于过程中，则 ``OPTG`` 和 ``FREQUENCIES`` "
"命令也必须位于该过程中。此外，没有能量计算的任何过程不得直接位于 ``FREQUENCIES`` 或 ``OPTG`` 之前。"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "The following *options* are available:"
msgstr "以下 *选项* 可用："

msgid ""
"``ANALYTICAL`` Use analytical second derivatives of the energy. At present, "
"analytical second derivatives are only possible for closed shell Hartree-"
"Fock (HF) and MCSCF wavefunctions without symmetry. It is not yet possible "
"to calculate IR-intensities analytically. Note that, due to technical "
"reasons, the analytical MCSCF second derivatives have to be computed in the "
"MCSCF-program using e.g. ``multi; cpmcscf,hess`` (see ``MULTI``) before they"
" can be used in ``FREQUENCIES``. If analytical MCSCF second derivatives have"
" been computed using ``multi; cpmcscf,hess``, ``FREQUENCIES`` will use them "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"``ANALYTICAL`` 使用能量的解析二阶导数。目前，解析二阶导数仅适用于无对称性的闭壳层 Hartree-Fock (HF) 和 MCSCF "
"波函数。目前尚无法解析计算红外强度。请注意，由于技术原因，解析 MCSCF 二阶导数必须在 MCSCF 程序中使用例如 ``multi; "
"cpmcscf,hess``\\ （参见 ``MULTI``\\ ）进行计算，然后才能在 ``FREQUENCIES`` 中使用。如果已使用 "
"``multi; cpmcscf,hess`` 计算了解析 MCSCF 二阶导数，\\ ``FREQUENCIES`` 将默认使用它们。"

msgid ""
"``CENTRAL`` Use central differences/high quality force constants (default)."
msgstr "``CENTRAL`` 使用中心差分/高质量力常数（默认）。"

msgid ""
"``NUMERICAL`` Differentiate the energy twice, using central differences."
msgstr "``NUMERICAL`` 使用中心差分对能量进行两次微分。"

msgid ""
"``FORWARD`` Use forward differences/low quality force constants (only "
"effective if gradients are available)."
msgstr "``FORWARD`` 使用前向差分/低质量力常数（仅在梯度可用时有效）。"

msgid "``AUTO`` Same as ``SYMM=AUTO``, see above."
msgstr "``AUTO`` 与 ``SYMM=AUTO`` 相同，见上文。"

msgid "``NOAUTO|NOSYM`` Same as ``SYMM=NO``, see above."
msgstr "``NOAUTO|NOSYM`` 与 ``SYMM=NO`` 相同，见上文。"

msgid ""
"``RESTART`` Attempt to restart a previous numerical frequency/hessian "
"calculation using default task record."
msgstr "``RESTART`` 尝试使用默认任务记录重新启动先前的数值频率/Hessian 矩阵计算。"

msgid "``NEW`` Recompute hessian, even if a hessian is already available."
msgstr "``NEW`` 即使已有 Hessian 矩阵，也重新计算。"

msgid ""
"``PROJECT`` Project rotations and translations out of the hessian (default)."
msgstr "``PROJECT`` 将旋转和平移从 Hessian 矩阵中投影出去（默认）。"

msgid ""
"``NOPROJECT`` Don’t project rotations and translations out of the hessian."
msgstr "``NOPROJECT`` 不将旋转和平移从 Hessian 矩阵中投影出去。"

msgid "``DEBUG`` Print Debug information, same as ``PRINT=1``."
msgstr "``DEBUG`` 打印调试信息，等同于 ``PRINT=1``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"For compatibility with older MOLPRO versions many of the options can also be"
" set using directives, as described in the following sections."
msgstr "为了与旧版 MOLPRO 兼容，许多选项也可以通过指令设置，如下文所述。"

msgid "Printing options (PRINT)"
msgstr "打印选项 (PRINT)"

msgid "This directive can be used to control the output:"
msgstr "该指令可用于控制输出："

msgid "The following *options* can be given:"
msgstr "可指定以下 *options*\\ ："

msgid ""
"``HESSIAN`` Print the force constant matrix (hessian) i.e. the second "
"derivative matrix of the energy and the mass weighted hessian matrix."
msgstr "``HESSIAN`` 打印力常数矩阵 (hessian)，即能量的二阶导数矩阵和质量加权的 Hessian 矩阵。"

msgid ""
"``LOW`` Print low vibrational frequencies (i.e. the 5 or 6 frequencies "
"belonging to rotations and translations) and their normal modes (default; "
"``LOW=-1`` suppresses the print)."
msgstr "``LOW`` 打印低频振动频率（即属于转动和平动的 5 或 6 个频率）及其简正模式（默认；\\ ``LOW=-1`` 将抑制打印）。"

msgid "Saving the hessian and other information (SAVE)"
msgstr "保存 Hessian 矩阵及其他信息 (SAVE)"

msgid "Restarting a hessian/Frequency calculation (START)"
msgstr "重新启动 Hessian 矩阵/频率计算 (START)"

msgid "The following options can be given:"
msgstr "可以给出以下选项："

msgid "Coordinates for numerical hessian calculations (COORD)"
msgstr "数值 Hessian 矩阵计算的坐标 (COORD)"

msgid "*type* can be one of the following:"
msgstr "*type* 可以是以下之一："

msgid ""
"``UNIQUE`` Use symmetry-unique displacements in the numerical calculation of"
" the hessian (default)."
msgstr "``UNIQUE`` 在 Hessian 矩阵的数值计算中使用对称性唯一的位移（默认）。"

msgid "``3N`` Don’t use symmetry-unique displacements (not recommended)."
msgstr "``3N`` 不使用对称性唯一的位移（不推荐）。"

msgid "Stepsizes for numerical hessian calculations (STEP)"
msgstr "数值 Hessian 矩阵计算的步长 (STEP)"

msgid ""
"determines the step size of the numerical differentiation of the energy or "
"the gradient. The default step size is *rstep*\\ =0.01 a.u."
msgstr "确定能量或梯度的数值微分的步长。默认步长为 *rstep*\\ =0.01 a.u."

msgid "Numerical hessian using energy variables (VARIABLE)"
msgstr "使用能量变量计算数值 Hessian 矩阵 (VARIABLE)"

msgid ""
"Defines a variable *name* which holds the energy value to be used for "
"computing the hessian using finite differences. By default, this is "
"``ENERGY(1)`` as set by the most recent program. For other variables which "
"can be used see section `optimizing energy variables (VARIABLE) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-energy-variables-variable>`__. "
"Note that numerical hessians cannot be computed when dummy atoms holding "
"basis functions are present."
msgstr ""
"定义一个变量 *name*\\ ，该变量保存用于通过有限差分计算 Hessian 矩阵的能量值。默认情况下，这是由最近程序设置的 "
"``ENERGY(1)``\\ 。有关可使用的其他变量，请参阅章节 `optimizing energy variables (VARIABLE) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-energy-variables-variable>`__\\ "
"。请注意，当存在带有基函数的哑原子时，无法计算数值 Hessian 矩阵。"

msgid "Thermodynamical properties (THERMO)"
msgstr "热力学性质 (THERMO)"

msgid ""
"It is also possible to calculate the thermodynamical properties of the "
"molecule. Since Molpro can only handle Abelian point groups it is necessary "
"to give the point group of the molecule in the input file:"
msgstr "也可以计算分子的热力学性质。由于 Molpro 只能处理阿贝尔点群，因此必须在输入文件中给出分子的点群："

msgid ""
"*pointgroup* has to be the Schoenflies Symbol (e.g. ``C3v`` for ammonia; "
"linear molecules have to be ``C*v`` or ``D*h`` respectively). If no point "
"group is given, the point group is determined automatically, but only "
"Abelian groups (D2H and subgroups) are recognized. If the molecule has "
"higher symmetry this may eventually cause deviations in the rotational "
"entropy."
msgstr ""
"*pointgroup* 必须是 Schoenflies 符号（例如，氨为 ``C3v``\\ ；线性分子必须分别为 ``C*v`` 或 "
"``D*h``\\ ）。如果未给出点群，则会自动确定点群，但仅识别阿贝尔群（D2H 及其子群）。如果分子具有更高的对称性，这最终可能导致转动熵的偏差。"

msgid ""
"The temperature (in K), pressure (in atm) or a range of temperatures (in K) "
"can be given as options."
msgstr "温度（单位：K）、压力（单位：atm）或一个温度范围（单位：K）可以作为选项给出。"

msgid ""
"If no temperature or pressure is specified the zero-point vibrational energy"
" and the enthalpy :math:`H(T)-H(0)` [kJ/mol], heat capacity :math:`C_v` "
"[J/mol K] and entropy :math:`S` [J/mol K] are calculated for standard "
"temperature and pressure (:math:`T=298.150` [K], :math:`p=1` [atm])."
msgstr ""
"如果未指定温度或压力，则计算零点振动能以及标准温度和压力（\\ :math:`T=298.150` [K], :math:`p=1` [atm]）下的焓"
" :math:`H(T)-H(0)` [kJ/mol]、热容 :math:`C_v` [J/mol K] 和熵 :math:`S` [J/mol K]。"

msgid ""
"The ``FREQUENCIES`` program sets the variable ``ZPE`` containing the zero-"
"point-energy of the harmonic vibrations in atomic units. If the ``THERMO`` "
"option is used, the variables ``HTOTAL`` and ``GTOTAL``, containing the "
"enthalpy and the free enthalpy of the system in atomic units, are also set."
msgstr ""
"``FREQUENCIES`` 程序会设置变量 ``ZPE``\\ ，其中包含谐波振动的零点能（以原子单位计）。如果使用了 ``THERMO`` "
"选项，还会设置变量 ``HTOTAL`` 和 ``GTOTAL``\\ ，分别包含系统的焓和自由焓（以原子单位计）。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "``FREQUENCIES,options, [forces:frequencies]``"
msgstr "``FREQUENCIES,options, [forces:frequencies]``"

msgid ""
"Calculate harmonic vibrational frequencies and normal modes. For the "
"calculation of anharmonic vibrational frequencies see sections `POTENTIAL "
"ENERGY SURFACES (SURF) <pes_generators.html#potential-energy-surfaces-"
"surf>`__ to :doc:`vibration correlation programs "
"<vibration_correlation_programs>`. The hessian is calculated analytically or"
" numerically by finite differences in 3N cartesian coordinates (Z-Matrix "
"coordinates will be destroyed on entry). If analytic gradients are available"
" these are differentiated once to build the hessian, otherwise the energy is"
" differentiated twice. If for the wavefunction method dipole moments are "
"available, the dipole derivatives and the IR intensities are also "
"calculated. Note that numerical hessians cannot be computed when dummy atoms"
" holding basis functions are present. To get reasonable results it is "
"necessary to do a geometry optimization before using the frequency "
"calculation."
msgstr ""
"计算简谐振动频率和简正模式。关于非简谐振动频率的计算，参见 `POTENTIAL ENERGY SURFACES (SURF) "
"<pes_generators.html#potential-energy-surfaces-surf>`__ 到 :doc:`振动关联程序 "
"<vibration_correlation_programs>` 章节。Hessian 采用解析方法或在 3N "
"笛卡尔坐标下用有限差分法数值计算（进入时将破坏 Z-Matrix 坐标）。如果解析梯度可用，则对其微分一次来构建 "
"Hessian；否则对能量微分两次。如果波函数方法有偶极矩可用，还会计算偶极导数和红外强度。注意，当存在携带基函数的哑原子时，无法计算数值 "
"Hessian。为获得合理结果，在使用频率计算前必须先做几何优化。"

msgid ""
"**``SYMM``\\ =\\ ``AUTO|NO``** During the numerical calculation of the "
"hessian, the symmetry of the molecule may be lowered. Giving ``SYMM``\\ =\\ "
"``AUTO`` the program uses the maximum possible symmetry of the molecular "
"wavefunction in each energy/gradient calculation, and this option therefore "
"minimizes the computational effort. With ``SYMM``\\ =\\ ``NO`` no symmetry "
"is used during the frequency calculation (default). For single reference "
"calculations like HF, MP2, CCSD, RCCSD the ``AUTO`` option can be safely "
"used and is recommended. However, the ``AUTO`` option cannot be used for "
"multireference methods (MCSCF/MRCI/ACPF/AQCC/RS2). If given, the option is "
"disabled in these cases. For these methods frequency calculations are only "
"possible without symmetry. Symmetry is turned off automatically if the state"
" symmetry is 1. Note that this may fail if there are lower states in other "
"symmetries. Use of ``RESTRICT``, ``SELECT``, ``REF``, ``PROJECT``, "
"``LOCAL``, state-averaged MCSCF will lead on errors unless the calculation "
"is performed in :math:`C_1` symmetry In such cases the whole calculation "
"must be done without symmetry."
msgstr ""
"**``SYMM``\\ =\\ ``AUTO|NO``** 在数值计算 Hessian 期间，分子的对称性可能会降低。指定 ``SYMM``\\ "
"=\\ ``AUTO`` 时，程序在每次能量/梯度计算中使用分子波函数的最大可能对称性，因此该选项可最小化计算量。指定 ``SYMM``\\ =\\ "
"``NO`` 时，频率计算中不使用对称性（默认）。对于 HF、MP2、CCSD、RCCSD 等单参考计算，可安全使用 ``AUTO`` "
"选项，且推荐使用。然而，\\ ``AUTO`` "
"选项不能用于多参考方法（MCSCF/MRCI/ACPF/AQCC/RS2）。若指定，则在这些情况下该选项被禁用。对于这些方法，频率计算只能在没有对称性的情况下进行。若态对称性为"
" 1，则自动关闭对称性。注意，如果其他对称性中存在更低态，这可能会失败。使用 ``RESTRICT``\\ 、\\ ``SELECT``\\ 、\\ "
"``REF``\\ 、\\ ``PROJECT``\\ 、\\ ``LOCAL``\\ 、态平均 MCSCF 将导致错误，除非在 :math:`C_1`"
" 对称性下执行计算。在此类情况下，整个计算必须在无对称性下进行。"

msgid ""
"**``HESSREC|SAVE``\\ =\\ *record*** Save hessian to *record*. By default the"
" hessian is saved on record 5300.2."
msgstr ""
"**``HESSREC|SAVE``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 将 Hessian 保存到 *\\ "
"record*。默认情况下，Hessian 保存在记录 5300.2 上。"

msgid ""
"**``FREQREC``\\ =\\ *record*** Save frequencies and normal modes to *record*"
" (default 5400.2) This information is used, e.g., by the VSCF/VCI program."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``TASKREC``\\ =\\ *record*** Save task information in numerical hessian "
"calculation to the given record. This information is required for a restart "
"of a numerical hessian calculation. By default, the information is saved on "
"record 5500.2."
msgstr ""
"**``TASKREC``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 将数值 Hessian 计算中的任务信息保存到给定记录。重启数值 Hessian "
"计算需要此信息。默认情况下，信息保存在记录 5500.2 上。"

msgid ""
"**``READH|START``\\ =\\ *record*** Use hessian from previously saved on "
"*record*. If the hessian has been computed for the current method and "
"geometry already, it is used by default."
msgstr ""
"**``READH|START``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 使用之前保存在 *\\ record* 上的 "
"Hessian。如果已经针对当前方法和几何结构计算过 Hessian，则默认使用它。"

msgid ""
"**``READF``\\ =\\ *record*** Read frequencies and normal modes from "
"previously saved on *record*.."
msgstr "**``READF``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 从之前保存在 *\\ record* 上的记录读取频率和简正模式。"

msgid ""
"**``RESTART``\\ =\\ *record*** Attempt to restart a previous numerical "
"frequency/hessian calculation using task record *record*."
msgstr "**``RESTART``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 尝试使用任务记录 *\\ record* 重启之前的数值频率/Hessian 计算。"

msgid ""
"**``LOW``\\ =\\ *value*** Threshold for printing low frequencies in cm\\ "
":math:`^{-1}`. If this option is given, frequencies below the given value "
"are not printed. By default, all frequencies are printed."
msgstr ""
"**``LOW``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 打印低频率的阈值，单位为 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ "
"。若给出此选项，则低于给定值的频率不会被打印。默认情况下，打印所有频率。"

msgid ""
"**``STEP``\\ =\\ *value*** Determines the step size of the numerical "
"differentiation of the energy or the gradient. The default step size is 0.01"
" a.u."
msgstr "**``STEP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 确定能量或梯度数值微分的步长。默认步长为 0.01 a.u.。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXTASK``\\ =\\ *value*** Stop the calculation if the number of tasks is"
" exceeded (the calculation can be restarted later)."
msgstr "**``MAXTASK``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 若任务数超过给定值则停止计算（之后可重启计算）。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXCPU``\\ =\\ *value*** Stop the calculation if the given CPU-time (in "
"sec) exceeded (the calculation can be restarted later). Only possible in "
"serial mode, and not for analytically computed frequencies."
msgstr ""
"**``MAXCPU``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 若超过给定 CPU "
"时间（秒）则停止计算（之后可重启计算）。仅在串行模式下可行，且不适用于解析计算的频率。"

msgid ""
"**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *value*** Print option. If *value* is greater or equal to "
"zero, the hessian and other information is printed (default :math:`-1`)."
msgstr ""
"**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 打印选项。若 *\\ value* 大于或等于零，则打印 Hessian 和其他信息（默认"
" :math:`-1`\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**``SCALE``\\ =\\ *value*** Scaling factor for frequencies. The scaled "
"frequencies are used to compute the ZPE and thermodynamic properties."
msgstr "**``SCALE``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 频率的标度因子。标度后的频率用于计算 ZPE 和热力学性质。"

msgid ""
"**``STARTCMD``\\ =\\ *command*** Specifies a start command. In each "
"frequency calculation step, all input beginning with command to the current "
"FREQ or HESSIAN command is processed."
msgstr ""
"**``STARTCMD``\\ =\\ *\\ command*** 指定启动命令。在每个频率计算步骤中，处理从 command 开始到当前 FREQ"
" 或 HESSIAN 命令的所有输入。"

msgid "``PRINT,options``"
msgstr "``PRINT,options``"

msgid ""
"**``LOW``\\ =\\ *value*** Threshold for printing low vibrations in cm\\ "
":math:`^{-1}` (default 150). If a value :math:`>0` is given, frequencies "
"below this value are not printed."
msgstr ""
"**``LOW``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 打印低振动的阈值，单位为 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ （默认 150）。若给出 "
":math:`>0` 的值，则低于此值的频率不会被打印。"

msgid "``SAVE,options``"
msgstr "``SAVE,options``"

msgid ""
"**``hessian=``\\ *record*** Save hessian to *record* (same effect as option "
"``HESSREC``). By default the hessian is saved on record 5300.2."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``FREQ=``\\ *record*** Save frequencies and normal modes to *record* (same"
" effect as option ``FREQREC``). By default the frequencies are saved on "
"record 5400.2."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``TASK=``\\ *record*** Save task information for possible restart of "
"hessian calculation to *record* (same effect as option ``TASKREC``). By "
"default the frequencies are saved on record 5500.2."
msgstr ""
"**``TASK=``\\ *\\ record*** 将任务信息保存到 *\\ record* 以便可能重启 Hessian 计算（效果同选项 "
"``TASKREC``\\ ）。默认情况下，频率保存在记录 5500.2 上。"

msgid "``START,options``"
msgstr "``START,options``"

msgid ""
"**``HESSIAN=``\\ *record*** Read hessian from record *record* (same effect "
"as option ``READHESS``)."
msgstr ""
"**``HESSIAN=``\\ *\\ record*** 从记录 *\\ record* 读取 Hessian（效果同选项 "
"``READHESS``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**``TASK=``\\ *record*** Read task information from record *record* and "
"restart numerical hessian calculation (same effect as option ``RESTART``)."
msgstr ""
"**``TASK=``\\ *\\ record*** 从记录 *\\ record* 读取任务信息并重启数值 Hessian 计算（效果同选项 "
"``RESTART``\\ ）。"

msgid "``COORD,type``"
msgstr "``COORD,type``"

msgid "``[STEP,rstep]``"
msgstr "``[STEP,rstep]``"

msgid "``VARIABLE,name; [freq:var]``"
msgstr "``VARIABLE,name; [freq:var]``"

msgid ""
"``THERMO,[SYM=pointgroup],[TEMP=value], [PRESS=value], [TMIN=value, "
"TMAX=value, TSTEP=value]``"
msgstr ""
"``THERMO,[SYM=pointgroup],[TEMP=value], [PRESS=value], [TMIN=value, "
"TMAX=value, TSTEP=value]``"

